'''Yoichi''' (よいち ''Yoichi'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Yoichi
|image = E 092.png
|appearance = [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 800¢ - 3160¢
}}

==Enemy==
Yoichi can be considered as a slightly weaker version of [[Le'boin]], as he has a higher damage output, twice the speed, and shorter attack frequency, but 10 less range allowing [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to outrange him and slightly less HP (more noticeable by his extra knockback). Yoichi also has a longer attack animation in both foreswing and backswing, making him easier to stall.

